Kolkata-A statistical analysis. Indian J Otolaryngol Head Neck Surg. 2005;57(3):219–225. doi: 10.1007/BF03008018. PMid:23120176 PMCid:3451350. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 16. Rourke T, Tassone P, Philpott C, Bath A. ENT cases seen at a local ‘walk-in centre’: a one year review. J Laryngol Otol. 2009;123(3):339–342. doi: 10.1017/S0022215108002508. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 17. Pino Rivero V, Trinidad Ruiz G, González Palomino A, Pardo Romero G, Pantoja Hernández CG, Marcos García M, et al. Consideraciones sobre las urgencias ORL. Análisis de 30000 pacientes atendidos en 10 a-os. Acta Otorrinolaring Esp. 2005;56(5):198–201. doi: 10.1016/S0001-6519(05)78600-3. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ]',10,'2025-10-14 13:20:02','2025-10-14 13:20:02');
